# Video Placeholder

This file represents where the actual `coffee-farm-processing.mp4` video should be placed.

## To add the actual video:
1. Remove this placeholder file
2. Add the actual `coffee-farm-processing.mp4` file
3. Ensure the video meets the specifications in README.md

## Current Status:
The website will gracefully fall back to the poster image when the video is not available.

## Video Specifications:
- Format: MP4 (H.264)
- Resolution: 1920x1080 or higher
- Duration: 30-60 seconds (looping)
- Size: < 10MB
- Audio: Muted or no audio (for autoplay compliance)
- Content: Coffee farm processing scenes